Rips_FulfillRandomWords
├── when called by an address that is not the VRF coordinator
│   └── it should revert with {OnlyCoordinatorCanFulfill}.
└── when called by the VRF coordinator
    ├── when the request ID does not map to a round
    │   └── it should revert with {RoundNotExist}.
    ├── when the round status is not VRFRequested
    │   └── it should revert with {InvalidRoundStatus}.
    ├── when the VRF request is expired
    │   └── it should revert with {RoundExpired}.
    └── when the round is valid and the request is not expired
        ├── it should derive a coprime value from the random word.
        ├── it should set randomB from the hash of the random word modulo ticket cap.
        ├── it should set round status to Finalized.
        └── it should emit a {RoundFinalized} event.
